# Preproduction Critique: Open-World Anime Action RPG

## Bottom line

The list reads like a full-scale live service, roughly 60+ systems. A three-person part-time team can realistically ship one tight combat loop, one small world, and one good progression loop. Most of the list is post-launch material. Hours are rough estimates; treat them as ±50%.

